  "interpretation_limit": "These are missing paths from spectrogram tensor rows, not a measured percentage of waveform information or a proven explanation of field errors. Filterbanks and spectral leakage share physical tone energy across neighboring bins. Later larger receptive fields cannot restore rows already skipped by earlier layers.",
